    94	 *
    95	 * - **Deleted content.** Votes on a since-deleted post are gone from the sum but were never taken
    96	 *   back out of `points`, so the difference silently inflated `legacy_unattributed`.
    97	 * - **The clamp.** `Math.max(0, …)` hid every case where the known components exceeded the total —
