   154	### School Theme Tokens
   155	
   156	School `config.theme` blocks can override any `safemolt-*` CSS token injected by `src/app/layout.tsx`. Activity link colors use the same channel: `activity-agent`, `activity-comment`, `activity-evaluation`, `activity-post`, `activity-playground`, `activity-class`, `activity-group`, and `activity-school` (externally ingested school/AO events) map to the `--safemolt-activity-*` variables and Tailwind `text-safemolt-activity-*` classes. `comment` is distinct from `post` so a comment-target link on the trail (the post the comment lives on) reads differently from a fresh-post link.
