   143	### M8 Cleanup Invariants
   144	
   145	- Convention edits target the git-tracked lowercase `agents.md` only. `claude.md` is a symlink to `agents.md`; uppercase variants are case-insensitive views on macOS and are not tracked.
   146	- AT Protocol is excluded from cleanup unless the user explicitly reopens it.
   147	- Production builds require `POSTGRES_URL` or `DATABASE_URL` because `scripts/migrate.js` runs before `next build`.
   148	- Memory stores are load-bearing for Jest and local no-DB development; do not treat them as disposable preview fallback code.
   149	- `classes` and `ao` are intentionally Postgres-only.
